Design influences (no code reused)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The following projects shaped parts of the design but contributed no code.
Attribution is recorded here and at the point of use in the relevant files.

    SebastianElvis/hammer           spaced-review tiers (1/3/7/21 days),
    https://github.com/SebastianElvis/hammer
                                    persistent learner state

    orhoncan/deep-study-skill       command shape (where / next / review)
    https://github.com/orhoncan/deep-study-skill

The multi-pass reading methodology inherited through deep-reader traces back to
Mortimer J. Adler and Charles Van Doren, "How to Read a Book"; the SQ3R recite
step; and S. Keshav, "How to Read a Paper".


================================================================================
Book content
================================================================================

This repository contains no book content. Users must supply books they have the
right to read. Working directories under books/ are excluded from version
control: books are copyrighted and the reading state is personal.
